{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in a house you half remember. Ten cursed teddies hide inside, playing a deadly game of hide-and-seek. Find them. Burn them.<br><br>The Mare stirs. Each flame feeds her fury, her rage seeping deeper into the house. Doors open on their own. Walls knock. Lights shatter. Whispers close in. Her presence intensifies, bringing deadlier encounters that demand faster reactions and sharper decisions.<br><br>Listen carefully. A giggle, a sneeze, the patter of tiny footsteps\u2014they betray the teddies\u2019 hiding places. But other sounds\u2014whispers, creaks, laughter, slamming doors, and flickering lights\u2014are the Mare's warning signs. When you hear them, it may already be too late.<br><br>Use tools like the flashlight, lighter, bulbs, and camera wisely\u2014while keeping an eye out for scarce resources. Be tactical, use them sparingly, and don\u2019t get caught in the dark with her. Every choice, and every second, matters.<br><br>One mistake, and you\u2019re hers. Death is not liberation\u2014it only pulls you deeper into the nightmare. To put an end to the torment, you must not be caught, but she must.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burn Ritual:</strong> Ten cursed teddies that hide dynamically and must all be destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Terror:</strong> Her rage rises with time and fire, intensifying the house with deadlier and more frequent encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen Your Senses:</strong> Track teddies by giggles, sneezes, and footsteps\u2014while staying alert to whispers, breaths, laughter, creaks in the floor, doors that open or slam shut, and lights that flicker or break. Every detail could be the warning that saves you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools at Your Disposal:</strong> Use tools such as the flashlight, lighter, bulbs, and camera\u2014and find rare supplies to keep them working. Scarce but invaluable for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Terror:</strong> A mix of constant dread and unpredictable scares that keep you on edge from beginning to end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath:</strong> One encounter is fatal. Every run is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsealed: The Mare is not only about survival, but about endurance, adaptation, and unraveling a nightmare that feels all too familiar. Learn from your mistakes, balance caution with desperation, and dare to face what hunts you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath the fear lies something more: fragments of memory, </i>remnants<i> of lives once lived, and truths that never fully align. The Mare may be more than just a sinister presence \u2014 perhaps someone you once knew, or perhaps not at all. A sense of familiarity lingers in every corner, yet nothing feels quite as it should \u2014 like fragments of truth and distortion colliding, fusing into something you can\u2019t quite place.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and intense scares that may not be suitable for all players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3492710?t=1759498890","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/bd47509fe31c08d6e9a0e3b34238d826ba5a0d8e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759498890","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/94ec2b14419205f0d0b0fa92836317c5621eabbc/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759498890","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3492710/94ec2b14419205f0d0b0fa92836317c5621eabbc/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759498890","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains intense horror elements, including disturbing imagery, dark environments, and moments of extreme tension and fear. While there are no graphic or bloody scenes, the presence of supernatural entities (the ghost/the mare) and unsettling paranormal activity may be distressing for younger or sensitive players. There is no sexual content."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake in a house you half remember. Ten cursed teddies hide inside, playing a deadly game of hide-and-seek. Find them. Burn them.<br><br>The Mare stirs. Each flame feeds her fury, her rage seeping deeper into the house. Doors open on their own. Walls knock. Lights shatter. Whispers close in. Her presence intensifies, bringing deadlier encounters that demand faster reactions and sharper decisions.<br><br>Listen carefully. A giggle, a sneeze, the patter of tiny footsteps\u2014they betray the teddies\u2019 hiding places. But other sounds\u2014whispers, creaks, laughter, slamming doors, and flickering lights\u2014are the Mare's warning signs. When you hear them, it may already be too late.<br><br>Use tools like the flashlight, lighter, bulbs, and camera wisely\u2014while keeping an eye out for scarce resources. Be tactical, use them sparingly, and don\u2019t get caught in the dark with her. Every choice, and every second, matters.<br><br>One mistake, and you\u2019re hers. Death is not liberation\u2014it only pulls you deeper into the nightmare. To put an end to the torment, you must not be caught, but she must.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Burn Ritual:</strong> Ten cursed teddies that hide dynamically and must all be destroyed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escalating Terror:</strong> Her rage rises with time and fire, intensifying the house with deadlier and more frequent encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sharpen Your Senses:</strong> Track teddies by giggles, sneezes, and footsteps\u2014while staying alert to whispers, breaths, laughter, creaks in the floor, doors that open or slam shut, and lights that flicker or break. Every detail could be the warning that saves you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools at Your Disposal:</strong> Use tools such as the flashlight, lighter, bulbs, and camera\u2014and find rare supplies to keep them working. Scarce but invaluable for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pure Terror:</strong> A mix of constant dread and unpredictable scares that keep you on edge from beginning to end.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Permadeath:</strong> One encounter is fatal. Every run is unforgiving.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Unsealed: The Mare is not only about survival, but about endurance, adaptation, and unraveling a nightmare that feels all too familiar. Learn from your mistakes, balance caution with desperation, and dare to face what hunts you.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath the fear lies something more: fragments of memory, </i>remnants<i> of lives once lived, and truths that never fully align. The Mare may be more than just a sinister presence \u2014 perhaps someone you once knew, or perhaps not at all. A sense of familiarity lingers in every corner, yet nothing feels quite as it should \u2014 like fragments of truth and distortion colliding, fusing into something you can\u2019t quite place.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Warning: This game contains flashing lights and intense scares that may not be suitable for all players.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Gamhalla"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https:/